{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, נְצַל","hw":"נְצַל","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">נְצַל</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. </strong><br><strong>Haph.</strong>  <strong> rescue, deliver (</strong>v. BH Egyptian Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">הנצל</span> <em>take away</em>, S-C<sup>C 10, D 18</sup><strong>)</strong>;—of God, abs.: Pt. act. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַצִּל</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:28\" href=\"/Daniel.6.28\">Dn 6:28</a>, Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהַצָּלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:29\" href=\"/Daniel.3.29\">3:29</a>; of man, sf. pers. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהַצָּלוּתֵהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:15\" href=\"/Daniel.6.15\">6:15</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, נְקֵא","prev":"BDB Aramaic, נְצַח"}